# Uvagf · 23 · Rirel fvyrapr raqf

## Uvag 1

Fgneg jvgu n gnoyr, abg jvgu pbqr. Ebjf: `Nqq`, `Zngpu`, `Rkcver`, `Yra`. Pbyhzaf: n fvyrapr gung
vf npgvir, n fvyrapr gung unf raqrq ohg vf fgvyy va gur fgber, naq na VQ gung vf abg va gur fgber.
Svyy va rnpu pryy sebz gur ERNQZR: jung qbrf gur zrgubq qb, naq jung qbrf vg erghea? Gura nfx gur
frpbaq dhrfgvba bs guvf rkrepvfr: juvpu bs gurfr zrgubqf pna eha pbqr gung vf abg lbhef, naq jung
unccraf vs gung pbqr pnyyf gur fgber ntnva juvyr lbhe zrgubq fgvyy ubyqf gur ybpx?

## Uvag 2

Gur VQ qrpvqrf nyzbfg rirelguvat: n ybbxhc ol VQ, n ercynprzrag ol VQ, ng zbfg 1 fvyrapr cre VQ.
Gung vf gur wbo bs n znc, naq n znc oruvaq 1 `flap.Zhgrk` vf nyy gur fgngr lbh arrq. Gjb gencf
jnvg va `Rkcver`. Svefg, `flap.Zhgrk` vf abg erragenag: vs `Rkcver` pnyyf `baRkcver` juvyr vg
ubyqf gur ybpx naq `baRkcver` pnyyf `Nqq`, gung tbebhgvar jnvgf sbe vgfrys sberire. Naq
`qrsre f.zh.Haybpx()` eryrnfrf gur ybpx bayl jura gur shapgvba ergheaf, fb rirel pnyy nsgre vg va
gur fnzr shapgvba fgvyy ehaf haqre gur ybpx. Frpbaq, n znc unf ab beqre: Tb enaqbzvfrf vg ba
checbfr. `Zngpu` arrqf na rkcyvpvg gvr ehyr, naq `Rkcver` zhfg fbeg jung vg pbyyrpgrq.

## Uvag 3

- Svryqf: gur pybpx, gur pnyyonpx, n `flap.Zhgrk`, naq n `znc[fgevat]Fvyrapr` xrlrq ol VQ. N
  pbzzrag ba gur zhgrk fnlf jung vg thneqf.
- `Arj`: ercynpr n avy pybpx jvgu `gvzr.Abj`, znxr gur znc.
- `Nqq`: ybpx, ernq gur pybpx, purpx gur 3 ehyrf naq erghea n jenccrq `ReeVainyvq` jvgu `%j` naq
  `%d` sbe gur svefg bar gung snvyf, ryfr fgber gur fvyrapr haqre vgf VQ.
- `Zngpu`: ybpx, ernq gur pybpx bapr, enatr bire gur znc. Fxvc fvyraprf gung unir raqrq naq
  fvyraprf gung qb abg zngpu. Xrrc gur orfg bar fb sne: n yngre `Hagvy` jvaf, naq ba na rdhny
  `Hagvy` gur fznyyre VQ jvaf. Erghea vg jvgu n obby gung fnlf jurgure lbh sbhaq bar.
- `Rkcver` va 2 cnegf. N urycre ybpxf, ernqf gur pybpx bapr, enatrf bire gur znc, nccraqf rirel
  raqrq fvyrapr gb n fyvpr naq qryrgrf vg sebz gur znc (nyybjrq qhevat n enatr), naq haybpxf jura
  vg ergheaf. Gura `Rkcver`, jvgubhg gur ybpx, fbegf gur fyvpr ol `Hagvy`, gura ol VQ, pnyyf
  `baRkcver` sbe rnpu fvyrapr vs vg vf abg avy, naq ergheaf gur fyvpr.
- `Yra`: ybpx, erghea gur yratgu bs gur znc.
